# Momen Tasks — Production frontend env (Vite `mode=production`).
#
# These are intentionally EMPTY. In Vite, an empty var still counts as "set"
# and OVERRIDES the `localhost` values from the root `.env`, which is exactly
# how `localhost:3000` used to get baked into the production SPA bundle.
#
# Empty VITE_API_URL  -> client.ts uses the relative path "/api/v1"
#                       (same-origin on Vercel, routed to the backend by vercel.json)
# Empty VITE_WS_URL   -> websocket.ts uses a same-origin connection
#
# Do NOT put `http://localhost` here under any circumstance. To point the
# frontend at a DIFFERENT backend origin, set the real absolute URL instead
# (e.g. VITE_API_URL=https://api.momen-tasks.app/api/v1). On Vercel, vars set
# in the Vercel dashboard take precedence over this file.
VITE_API_URL=
VITE_WS_URL=
